Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:05.02,Default,KUROBE {FLASHBACK},0,0,0,,Players, please take a short break \Nbefore the third-round matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:09.43,Default,KUROBE {FLASHBACK},0,0,0,,Once the #2 doubles result comes in,\N we'll start them concurrently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:12.99,Default,TANEGASHIMA {Flashback},0,0,0,,30-40.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:15.46,Italics,YANAGI {flashback},0,0,0,,Unfortunately for them, this game...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:18.47,Italics,YUKIMURA AND YANAGI {flashback},0,0,0,,...is ours to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:19.99,Default,KINTARO {flashback},0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.21,Default,KINTARO {flashback},0,0,0,,They're in a straight line?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:25.67,Italics,KINTARO {flashback},0,0,0,,Which way are they going? \NForward? To the side?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.54,Italics,KINTARO {flashback},0,0,0,,Which way should I hit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:32.66,Default,MARUI {flashback},0,0,0,,If he hits it straight, Yanagi can counter\Nthe Pinnacle of Perfection, I tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:34.34,Default,KITE {flashback},0,0,0,,If he aims for either side,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:39.10,Default,KITE {flashback},0,0,0,,Yukimura can easily handle it\N using Mirage Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:42.74,Default,KINTARO {flashback},0,0,0,,This ain't no time to be hesitatin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:51.36,Default,YANAGI {flashback},0,0,0,,The probability of you \Navoiding Seiichi is 100%.
