Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.89,0:01:04.88,Default,TANEGASHIMA {flashback},0,0,0,,Game, set, and match, \NOmagari and Toyama. 7-5.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.56,0:01:09.02,Default,KUROBE,0,0,0,,In #2 doubles, \NOmagari and Toyama advanced.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.02,0:01:13.39,Default,KUROBE,0,0,0,,So whoever wins the next match in \Ntheir block will secure a spot in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:19.51,Default,KUROBE,0,0,0,,But it seems the other four pairs got tired\N of waiting for the #2 doubles pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:25.83,Default,KUROBE,0,0,0,,Is there a reason you scheduled the next round\N of matches to start at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:32.36,Default,MIFUNE,0,0,0,,This is his last chance.
